#. i18n: file: dialogs/ProtectionWidget.ui:34
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QWidget, ProtectionWidget)
#: rc.cpp:410
msgid ""
"This tab enables you to set Cell Protection. All cells are protected by "
"default (that means cell content cannot be changed) and for the cell "
"protection to be active you also need to protect the sheet using the Tools -"
"> Protect Document -> Protect Sheet... menu and to provide a password.\n"
"You can also hide the cell formula in order to protect the way you calculate "
"the formula. This also needs to enable shet protection to work.\n"
"You can hide the cell content with Hide all and again this needs sheet "
"protection.\n"
"You can learn more about all these settings in the User Manual in the "
"Advanced KSpread chapter."
msgstr ""
"Mit disse Koort lett sik de Zellschuul fastleggen. Standardwies sünd all "
"Zellen schuult (dat bedüüdt, dat sik de Zellinholt nich ännern lett), un "
"dormit de Zellschuul aktiv warrt, mutt de Tabell ok noch mit dat Menü "
"\"Warktüüch -> Dokment schulen -> Tabell schulen...\" mit en Passwoort "
"schuult wesen.\n"
"De Zellformel lett sik ok versteken, dormit sik de Utrekenmetood för de "
"Formel nich rutfinnen lett. Dor mutt de Tabell ok för schuult wesen.\n"
"De Zellinholt lett sik mit de Funkschoon \"All versteken\" ok versteken. Ok "
"dor mutt de Tabell för schuult wesen.\n"
"Binnen den Afsnitt \"Verwiedert\" in't Brukerhandbook vun KSpread lett sik "
"mehr över disse Instellen finnen."

#. i18n: file: dialogs/ProtectionWidget.ui:40
#. i18n: ectx: property (title), widget (QGroupBox, groupBox2)
#: rc.cpp:416
msgid "Printing"
msgstr "Drucken"

#. i18n: file: dialogs/ProtectionWidget.ui:47
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_bDontPrint)
#: rc.cpp:419
msgid ""
"If checked, the content of the cell will not be printed. If this is not "
"checked (default), the cell content will be printed.\n"
"Note that you can print it even if the cell is protected"
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit anmaakt is, warrt de Zellinholt nich druckt. Wenn dit nich anmaakt "
"is (Standard), warrt de Zellinholt druckt.\n"
"Beacht, dat he sik ok drucken lett, wenn de Zell schuult is"

#. i18n: file: dialogs/ProtectionWidget.ui:50
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_bDontPrint)
#: rc.cpp:423
msgid "&Do not print text"
msgstr "Text nich &drucken"

#. i18n: file: dialogs/ProtectionWidget.ui:60
#. i18n: ectx: property (title), widget (QGroupBox, groupBox1)
#: rc.cpp:426
msgid "Protection"
msgstr "Schuul"

#. i18n: file: dialogs/ProtectionWidget.ui:68
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_bHideAll)
#: rc.cpp:429
msgid ""
"This hides the cell content and works only when the sheet is protected. "
"Whether the cell itself is protected or not does not matter."
msgstr ""
"Dit versteekt den Zellinholt un arbeidt bloots, wenn de Tabell schuult is, "
"eendoont, wat de Zell sülvst schuult is oder nich."

#. i18n: file: dialogs/ProtectionWidget.ui:71
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_bHideAll)
#: rc.cpp:432
msgid "Hide &all"
msgstr "&All versteken"

#. i18n: file: dialogs/ProtectionWidget.ui:96
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_bIsProtected)
#: rc.cpp:435
msgid ""
"If checked, the cell content will be protected. This is the default "
"behaviour. You need to protect the whole sheet using theTools->Protect "
"document->Protect Sheet... menu for this individual cell protection to work. "
"See the manual for more details in the Advanced KSpread chapter. When a cell "
"is protected, its content cannot be changed."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit anmaakt is, warrt de Zellinholt schuult. Dit is dat "
"Standardbedregen. Dormit disse Enkelzellschuul arbeidt, mutt de heel Tabell "
"mit \"Warktüüch -> Dokment schulen -> Tabell schulen\" schuult wesen. Binnen "
"den Afsnitt \"Verwiedert\" in't Brukerhandbook vun KSpread lett sik mehr "
"över disse Instellen finnen. Wenn en Zell schuult is, lett sik ehr Inholt "
"nich ännern."

#. i18n: file: dialogs/ProtectionWidget.ui:99
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_bIsProtected)
#: rc.cpp:438
msgid "&Protected"
msgstr "&Schuult"

#. i18n: file: dialogs/ProtectionWidget.ui:129
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_bHideFormula)
#: rc.cpp:441
msgid ""
"When this is checked, the cell is still visible. However, its contents do "
"not appear in the Formula bar. Hiding formula is only working for cells that "
"contain formulae so the user cannot view the formula. And the sheet must be "
"protected for this to work."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit anmaakt is, lett sik de Zell noch ankieken, man ehr Inholt warrt "
"nich binnen den Formelbalken wiest. Formeln laat sik vör den Bruker bloots "
"versteken, wenn de Zellen Formeln bargt un de Tabell schuult is."

#. i18n: file: dialogs/ProtectionWidget.ui:132
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_bHideFormula)
#: rc.cpp:444
msgid "&Hide formula"
msgstr "Formel &versteken"

