#. i18n: file: part/dialogs/SheetSelectWidget.ui:126
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (K3ListView, ListViewSelected)
#: rc.cpp:768
msgid ""
"<b>List of sheets to print.</b><br>\n"
"Only the sheets listed here will be printed in the order of listing. You can "
"change the print order with the up and down buttons.<br>\n"
"It is even possible to print a sheet more than once. Just insert the desired "
"sheet again and order the list to your needs."
msgstr ""
"<b>List vun Tabellen för't Drucken.</b><br>\n"
"Bloots de hier oplist Tabellen warrt in de angeven Reeg druckt. Ehr "
"Druckreeg lett sik mit de Knööp \"hooch\" un \"daal\" ännern.<br>\n"
"En Blatt lett sik ok mehrmaal drucken, wenn dat nochmaal inföögt warrt. De "
"List lett sik na Möög sorteren."

