msgstr "COMPOUND(5000;0,12;4;5) gifft \"9030,56\" torüch"

#. i18n: file: functions/financial.xml:171
#: xml_doc.cpp:1422
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The CONTINUOUS() function calculates the return on continuously compounded "
"interest, given the principal, nominal rate and time in years. For example: "
"$1000 earning 10% for 1 year becomes CONTINUOUS(1000;.1;1) or $1105.17."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon CONTINUOUS() gifft den Ennweert vun en fast optinst Bedrag "
"torüch, angeven dör Startbedrag, nominaal Tinssatz un Tiet in Johren. Ut "
"1000 Dollar mit 10% Tinsen för een Johr warrt a.B. CONTINUOUS(1000;.1;1) "
"oder 1105,17 Dollar."

