#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:31
#: xml_doc.cpp:3368
msgid ""
"The AVEDEV() function calculates the average of the absolute deviations of a "
"data set from their mean."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon AVEDEV() reekt den Dörsnitt vun de afsoluten Verschelen vun en "
"Datensett ut ehr Middelweerten ut."

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:32
#: xml_doc.cpp:3370
msgid "AVEDEV(value;value;...)"
msgstr "AVEDEV(Weert;Weert;...)"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:33
#: xml_doc.cpp:3372
msgid "AVEDEV(11.4;17.3;21.3;25.9;40.1) returns 7.84"
msgstr "AVEDEV(11,4;17.3;21,3;25,9;40,1) gifft \"7,84\" torüch"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:34
#: xml_doc.cpp:3374
msgid "AVEDEV(A1:A5) ..."
msgstr "AVEDEV(A1:A5) ..."

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:62
#: xml_doc.cpp:3386
msgid ""
"The AVERAGE() function calculates the average of all the values given as "
"parameters. You can calculate the average of a range AVERAGE(A1:B5) or a "
"list of values like AVERAGE(12;5;12.5)."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon AVERAGE() reekt den Dörsnitt vun all as Parameters angeven "
"Weerten ut. Een kann den Dörsnitt vun en Rebeet AVERAGE(A1:B5) oder en List "
"vun Weerten liek AVERAGE(12;5;12.5) utreken."

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:63
#: xml_doc.cpp:3388
msgid "AVERAGE(value;value;...)"
msgstr "AVERAGE(Weert;Weert;...)"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:64
#: xml_doc.cpp:3390
msgid "AVERAGE(12;5;7) equals 8"
msgstr "AVERAGE(12;5;7) gifft \"8\" torüch"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:65
#: xml_doc.cpp:3392
msgid "AVERAGE(12.5;2) equals 7.25"
msgstr "AVERAGE(12,5;2) gifft \"7,25\" torüch"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:77
#. i18n: file: functions/text.xml:311
#. i18n: file: functions/text.xml:315
#. i18n: file: functions/text.xml:319
#. i18n: file: functions/text.xml:323
#. i18n: file: functions/text.xml:327
#: xml_doc.cpp:3396 xml_doc.cpp:4558 xml_doc.cpp:4560 xml_doc.cpp:4562
#: xml_doc.cpp:4564 xml_doc.cpp:4566
msgid "String values"
msgstr "Tekenkeden"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:81
#: xml_doc.cpp:3398
msgid ""
"The AVERAGEA() calculates the average of the given arguments. Numbers, text "
"and logical values are included in the calculation too. If the cell contains "
"text or the argument evaluates to FALSE, it is counted as value zero (0). If "
"the argument evaluates to TRUE, it is counted as one (1). Note that empty "
"cells are not counted."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon AVERAGEA() reekt den Dörsnitt vun de angeven Parameters ut. "
"Tallen, Text un boolsch Weerten warrt ok inslaten. Wenn de Zell Text bargt "
"oder dat Resultaat \"falsch\" is, warrt de Weert as Null (0) tellt, un as "
"Een (1), wenn dat Argument \"wohr\" is. Beacht, dat leddig Zellen nich tellt "
"warrt."

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:82
#: xml_doc.cpp:3400
msgid "AVERAGEA(value;value;...)"
msgstr "AVERAGEA(Weert;Weert;...)"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:83
#: xml_doc.cpp:3402
msgid "AVERAGEA(11.4;17.3;\"sometext\";25.9;40.1) equals 18.94"
msgstr "AVERAGEA(11,4;17,3;\"wattext\";25,9;40,1) gifft \"18,94\" torüch"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:95
#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:131
#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:433
#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:462
#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:1628
#: xml_doc.cpp:3406 xml_doc.cpp:3428 xml_doc.cpp:3612 xml_doc.cpp:3632
#: xml_doc.cpp:4286
msgid "Alpha parameter"
msgstr "Alpha-Parameter"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:99
#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:135
#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:437
#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:466
#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:1632
#: xml_doc.cpp:3408 xml_doc.cpp:3430 xml_doc.cpp:3614 xml_doc.cpp:3634
#: xml_doc.cpp:4288
msgid "Beta parameter"
msgstr "Beta-Parameter"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:103
#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:139
#: xml_doc.cpp:3410 xml_doc.cpp:3432
msgid "Start"
msgstr "Start"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:107
#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:143
#: xml_doc.cpp:3412 xml_doc.cpp:3434
msgid "End"
msgstr "Enn"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:111
#: xml_doc.cpp:3414
msgid "Cumulative"
msgstr "Tosamenreekt"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:115
#: xml_doc.cpp:3416
msgid ""
"The BETADIST() function returns the cumulative beta probability density "
"function."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon BETADIST() gifft de kumuleert Beta-"
"Wohrschienlichkeitdichtfunkschoon torüch."

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:116
#: xml_doc.cpp:3418
msgid ""
"The third and fourth parameters are optional. They set the lower and upper "
"bounds, otherwise defaulting to 0.0 and 1.0 respectively."
msgstr ""
"De drüdde un de veerte Parameters sünd optschonaal. Se leggt de sietst un de "
"höögst Grenz fast. Anners warrt de Standardweerten 0,0 oder 1,0 bruukt."

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:117
#: xml_doc.cpp:3420
msgid "BETADIST(number;alpha;beta;start;end;[cumulative=TRUE])"
msgstr "BETADIST(Tall;Alpha;Beta;Start;Enn;[tosamenreekt=WOHR]))"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:118
#: xml_doc.cpp:3422
msgid "BETADIST(0.2859;0.2606;0.8105) equals 0.675444"
msgstr "BETADIST(0,2859;0,2606;0,8105) gifft \"0,675444\" torüch"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:119
#: xml_doc.cpp:3424
msgid "BETADIST(0.2859;0.2606;0.8105;0.2;0.9) equals 0.537856"
msgstr "BETADIST(0,2859;0,2606;0,8105;0,2;0,9) gifft \"0,537856\" torüch"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:147
#: xml_doc.cpp:3436
msgid ""
"The BETAINV() function returns the inverse of BETADIST(x;alpha;beta;a;b;TRUE"
"())."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon BETAINV() gifft de Inverschoon vun BETADIST(x;alpha;beta;a;b;"
"TRUE()) torüch."

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:148
#: xml_doc.cpp:3438
msgid ""
"The start and end parameters are optional. They set the lower and upper "
"bounds, otherwise defaulting to 0.0 and 1.0 respectively."
msgstr ""
"De Start- un Ennparameters sünd optschonaal. Se leggt de sietst un de höögst "
"Grenz fast. Anners warrt de Standardweerten 0,0 oder 1,0 bruukt."

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:149
#: xml_doc.cpp:3440
msgid "BETAINV(number;alpha;beta [; start=0 [; end=1]])"
msgstr "BETAINV(Tall;Alpha;Beta [; Start=0 [; Enn=1]])"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:150
#: xml_doc.cpp:3442
msgid "BETADIST(BETAINV(0.1;3;4);3;4) equals 0.1"
msgstr "BETADIST(BETAINV(0.1;3;4);3;4) gifft 0.1 torüch"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:151
#: xml_doc.cpp:3444
msgid "BETADIST(BETAINV(0.3;3;4);3;4) equals 0.3"
msgstr "BETADIST(BETAINV(0.3;3;4);3;4) gifft 0.3 torüch"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:164
#: xml_doc.cpp:3448
msgid "Degrees of freedom"
msgstr "Freeheitgraad"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:168
#: xml_doc.cpp:3450
msgid ""
"The CHIDIST() function returns the probability value from the indicated Chi "
"square that a hypothesis is confirmed."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon CHIDIST() gifft den Wohrschienlichkeitsweert vun dat angeven "
"Chi-Quadraat torüch, dat en Vermoden beglöövt warrt."

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:169
#: xml_doc.cpp:3452
msgid ""
"CHIDIST compares the Chi square value to be given for a random sample that "
"is calculated from the sum of (observed value-expected value)^2/expected "
"value for all values with the theoretical Chi square distribution and "
"determines from this the probability of error for the hypothesis to be "
"tested."
msgstr ""
"CHIDIST vergliekt den Weert vun Chi-Quadraat för en tofällig Steekproov, de "
"ut de Summ vun \"(beluert Weert-verwacht Weert)^2/verwacht Weert\" för all "
"Weerten mit mööglich Chi-Quadraatverdelen un reekt dor de "
"Fehlerwohrschienlichkeit för de Vermoden mit ut, de pröövt warrn schall."

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:170
#: xml_doc.cpp:3454
msgid "CHIDIST(number;degrees_freedom)"
msgstr "CHIDIST(Tall;Freeheitgraad)"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:171
#: xml_doc.cpp:3456
msgid "CHIDIST(13.27;5) returns 0.021"
msgstr "CHIDIST(13,27;5) gifft \"0,021\" torüch"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:179
#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:198
#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:931
#: xml_doc.cpp:3458 xml_doc.cpp:3470 xml_doc.cpp:3900
msgid "Total number of elements"
msgstr "Tall vun Elementen"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:183
#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:202
#: xml_doc.cpp:3460 xml_doc.cpp:3472
msgid "Number of elements to choose"
msgstr "Tall vun utsöökbor Elementen"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:187
#: xml_doc.cpp:3462
msgid ""
"The COMBIN() function calculates the count of possible combinations. The "
"first parameter is the total count of elements. The second parameter is the "
"count of elements to choose. Both parameters should be positive and the "
"first parameter should not be less than the second. Otherwise the function "
"returns an error."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon COMBIN() reekt de Tall vun mööglich Kombinatschonen ut. De "
"eerste Parameter is de Tall vun all Elementen tosamen. De twete Parameter is "
"de Tall vun Elementen för de Köör. Beed Parameters mööt positiv wesen un de "
"eerste Parameter schall nich lütter wesen as de twete. Anners gifft de "
"Funkschoon en Fehler ut."

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:188
#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:207
#: xml_doc.cpp:3464 xml_doc.cpp:3476
msgid "COMBIN(total;chosen)"
msgstr "COMBIN(tosamen;utsöcht)"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:189
#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:208
#: xml_doc.cpp:3466 xml_doc.cpp:3478
msgid "COMBIN(12;5) returns 792"
msgstr "COMBIN(12;5) gifft \"792\" torüch"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:190
#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:209
#: xml_doc.cpp:3468 xml_doc.cpp:3480
msgid "COMBIN(5;5) returns 1"
msgstr "COMBIN(5;5) gifft \"1\" torüch"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:206
#: xml_doc.cpp:3474
msgid ""
"The COMBINA() function calculates the count of possible combinations. The "
"first parameter is the total count of elements. The second parameter is the "
"count of elements to choose. Both parameters should be positive and the "
"first parameter should not be less than the second. Otherwise the function "
"returns an error."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon COMBINA() reekt de Tall vun mööglich Kombinatschonen ut. De "
"eerst Parameter is de Tall vun all Elementen tosamen. De tweet Parameter is "
"de Tall vun Elementen för de Köör. Beed Parameters mööt positiv wesen un de "
"eerste Parameter schall nich lütter wesen as de twete. Anners gifft de "
"Funkschoon en Fehler ut."

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:217
#: xml_doc.cpp:3482
msgid "Level of the confidence interval"
msgstr "Stoop vun't Konfidenzrebeet"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:221
#: xml_doc.cpp:3484
msgid "Standard deviation for the total population"
msgstr "Standardverscheel för de heel Populatschoon"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:225
#: xml_doc.cpp:3486
msgid "Size of the total population"
msgstr "Grött vun de heel Populatschoon"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:229
#: xml_doc.cpp:3488
msgid ""
"The CONFIDENCE() function returns the confidence interval for a population "
"mean."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon CONFIDENCE() gifft dat Konfidenzrebeet vun en Populatschoon "
"ehr Middelweert torüch."

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:230
#: xml_doc.cpp:3490
msgid ""
"The alpha parameter must be between 0 and 1 (non-inclusive), stddev must be "
"positive and size must be greater or equal to 1."
msgstr ""
"De Alpha-Parameter mutt twischen 0 un 1 liggen (nich-inklusiv), stddev mutt "
"positiv un Grött mutt grötter oder gliek 1 wesen."

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:231
#: xml_doc.cpp:3492
msgid "CONFIDENCE(alpha;stddev;size)"
msgstr "CONFIDENCE(alpha;stddev;Grött)"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:232
#: xml_doc.cpp:3494
msgid "CONFIDENCE(0.05;1.5;100) equals 0.294059"
msgstr "CONFIDENCE(0,05;1,5;100) gifft \"0,294059\" torüch"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:240
#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:259
#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:667
#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:912
#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:1105
#: xml_doc.cpp:3496 xml_doc.cpp:3506 xml_doc.cpp:3746 xml_doc.cpp:3890
#: xml_doc.cpp:4006
msgid "Cell range of values"
msgstr "Zellrebeet vun Weerten"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:244
#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:263
#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:916
#: xml_doc.cpp:3498 xml_doc.cpp:3508 xml_doc.cpp:3892
msgid "Second cell range of values"
msgstr "Tweet Zellrebeet vun Weerten"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:248
#: xml_doc.cpp:3500
msgid ""
"The CORREL() function calculates the correlation coefficient of two cell "
"ranges."
msgstr ""
"De Funkschoon CORREL() reekt den Korrelatschoonkoeffizient (Toorn-Biweert) "
"vun twee Zellrebeden ut."

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:249
#: xml_doc.cpp:3502
msgid "CORREL(range1; range2)"
msgstr "CORREL(Rebeet1; Rebeet2)"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:250
#: xml_doc.cpp:3504
msgid "CORREL(A1:A3; B1:B3)"
msgstr "CORREL(A1:A3; B1:B3)"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:267
#: xml_doc.cpp:3510
msgid "The COVAR() function calculates the covariance of two cell ranges."
msgstr "De Funkschoon COVAR() reekt de Kovarianz vun twee Zellrebeden ut."

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:268
#: xml_doc.cpp:3512
msgid "COVAR(range1; range2)"
msgstr "COVAR(Rebeet1; Rebeet2)"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:269
#: xml_doc.cpp:3514
msgid "COVAR(A1:A3; B1:B3)"
msgstr "COVAR(A1:A3; B1:B3)"

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:297
#: xml_doc.cpp:3526
msgid "The DEVSQ() function calculates the sum of squares of deviations."
msgstr "De Funkschoon DEVSQ() reekt de Summ vun Quadraten vun Verschelen ut."

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:298
