#: xml_doc.cpp:3620
msgid ""
"If the last parameter (cumulated) is 0, it calculates the density function; "
"if it's 1, the distribution is returned."
msgstr ""
"Wenn de leste Parameter (kumuleert) \"0\" is, warrt de Dichtfunkschoon "
"utreekt, wenn he \"1\" is, warrt de Verdelen torüchgeven."

